<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-VILNIAUS BANK IN TALKS FOR CANADIAN EXPORTS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-VILNIAUS BANK IN TALKS FOR CANADIAN EXPORTS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vilniaus Bank and the Canadian Export Development Corporation will cooperate in financing Canadian exports to Lithuania, the bank said in a statement Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Negotiations are going on concerning short-term and medium-term credit insurance to Vilniaus Bank or even projects financed directly through Vilniuas Bank in which local and Canadian companies participate,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>The Canadian Export Development Corporation works in Central and Eastern Europe to stimulate the activities of Canadian companies in the region.</p>
<p>Vilniaus Bank is one of Lithuania's leading private commercial banks.</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
